# Large model objects are regenerated, not versioned. The A5 STM refit (~159 MB) is
# rebuilt by `A5_FIT_ONLY=1 Rscript replication_repo/scripts/42_stm_refit_298_noparty.R`
# from the project root (~1.7 h). The small MoC draw files (*_moc_draws*.rds, ~58 KB)
# stay versioned.
output/rnr2026/A5_stm_model_298_noparty.rds

# Biography-audit files that quote the (non-redistributable) BCN biography text; regenerated by scripts/44 when the corpus is present
